[{"start":21440.462,"end":21441.462,"text":"Thank you. And"},{"start":21442.382,"end":21445.542,"text":"my name is Alessandro Gioni from CNR, Italy,"},{"start":21447.142,"end":21451.062,"text":"and representing in this moment ELTERA Research Infrastructure."},{"start":21451.722,"end":21453.182,"text":"First of all, I want to"},{"start":21454.062,"end":21457.262,"text":"describe the ELTERA Research Infrastructure."},{"start":21457.462,"end":21460.402,"text":"It is a pan-European research infrastructure,"},{"start":21461.202,"end":21462.702,"text":"and the mission is to"},{"start":21463.542,"end":21464.102,"text":"study the"},{"start":21465.282,"end":21469.162,"text":"ecology in terms of long-term ecological variation."},{"start":21469.662,"end":21469.942,"text":"And"},{"start":21472.042,"end":21475.702,"text":"the study is about structure, processes, and functions"},{"start":21476.762,"end":21480.282,"text":"in terrestrial, freshwater, and coastal, and transitional ecosystem."},{"start":21481.422,"end":21483.062,"text":"At the moment, ELTERA is"},{"start":21484.362,"end":21486.942,"text":"in Europe, is entered in"},{"start":21487.782,"end":21491.702,"text":"ESFRI road mapping 10 years ago. And I"},{"start":21491.802,"end":21494.482,"text":"hope, we hope to finish the"},{"start":21495.642,"end":21495.942,"text":"trip"},{"start":21497.002,"end":21497.882,"text":"in the next"},{"start":21499.642,"end":21500.082,"text":"month."},{"start":21503.182,"end":21504.762,"text":"Again, is a distributed"},{"start":21505.582,"end":21509.282,"text":"infrastructure with a real in situ"},{"start":21509.782,"end":21513.642,"text":"site or facilities that collect a"},{"start":21513.682,"end":21514.102,"text":"lot of"},{"start":21516.442,"end":21517.982,"text":"ecological parameter."},{"start":21518.822,"end":21520.022,"text":"This is an example of"},{"start":21521.742,"end":21522.542,"text":"the site."},{"start":21523.622,"end":21526.162,"text":"This is an example of a distributed"},{"start":21527.022,"end":21527.702,"text":"site for"},{"start":21528.542,"end":21532.142,"text":"European countries, but also external point is"},{"start":21537.122,"end":21539.722,"text":"a site that some"},{"start":21540.562,"end":21541.522,"text":"European countries"},{"start":21543.122,"end":21546.942,"text":"use for collecting information for other countries."},{"start":21547.562,"end":21549.742,"text":"And this is an example of a"},{"start":21550.542,"end":21551.122,"text":"sheet of"},{"start":21551.942,"end":21555.802,"text":"the site with a description, name, and so on, and"},{"start":21555.862,"end":21557.562,"text":"also the part of"},{"start":21560.842,"end":21561.842,"text":"geographical point."},{"start":21564.042,"end":21564.242,"text":"In"},{"start":21566.442,"end":21568.562,"text":"the site or in situ facility,"},{"start":21570.202,"end":21573.722,"text":"the people collect a lot of type of parameter,"},{"start":21573.922,"end":21577.482,"text":"ecosystem, chemical parameter, and soil or"},{"start":21577.562,"end":21581.442,"text":"atmospheric parameter, and also biological parameter, but is"},{"start":21581.482,"end":21583.342,"text":"not only the part of"},{"start":21585.022,"end":21588.722,"text":"the parameter that is collected in the"},{"start":21588.782,"end":21589.262,"text":"site."},{"start":21591.062,"end":21593.622,"text":"And for this session,"},{"start":21594.442,"end":21596.362,"text":"I want to say what is the"},{"start":21597.202,"end":21598.842,"text":"possibility to share this"},{"start":21600.082,"end":21600.582,"text":"type of"},{"start":21601.642,"end":21604.102,"text":"observation or parameter collected,"},{"start":21605.482,"end":21609.462,"text":"and the solution that we have in ELTERA RI"},{"start":21610.042,"end":21612.842,"text":"is a data template with a different"},{"start":21613.582,"end":21614.242,"text":"table"},{"start":21615.442,"end":21617.542,"text":"about the method, reference station,"},{"start":21618.602,"end":21620.382,"text":"event, sample, and"},{"start":21621.642,"end":21624.522,"text":"one about the license and"},{"start":21626.102,"end":21626.442,"text":"data."},{"start":21627.662,"end":21630.982,"text":"It's also provided as a CSV format,"},{"start":21631.702,"end":21634.022,"text":"and altogether is collected"},{"start":21635.182,"end":21635.502,"text":"using"},{"start":21637.522,"end":21638.282,"text":"a zip file,"},{"start":21639.282,"end":21642.822,"text":"for collect altogether the information."},{"start":21645.434,"end":21646.614,"text":"The data template"},{"start":21647.514,"end":21650.994,"text":"is a data specification that can contain the description of"},{"start":21651.634,"end":21654.754,"text":"required information, field, and templates"},{"start":21656.274,"end":21659.994,"text":"data. And for more information, it's possible to"},{"start":21660.014,"end":21663.954,"text":"download also the specification and"},{"start":21664.014,"end":21665.914,"text":"the document in"},{"start":21666.854,"end":21667.374,"text":"Zenodo."},{"start":21668.734,"end":21672.034,"text":"This is an example of data template with a"},{"start":21673.074,"end":21673.514,"text":"table."},{"start":21674.954,"end":21678.714,"text":"Again, it's like a relational database using the"},{"start":21678.934,"end":21679.354,"text":"CSV,"},{"start":21680.374,"end":21683.954,"text":"with some data, station, method, and"},{"start":21684.054,"end":21687.054,"text":"reference. This is an example of data."},{"start":21687.114,"end":21690.794,"text":"It's possible to store data using data row and data"},{"start":21690.854,"end":21693.414,"text":"column in different shape, but the same"},{"start":21694.434,"end":21695.114,"text":"information."},{"start":21696.534,"end":21699.754,"text":"What we have done at the moment"},{"start":21702.074,"end":21705.894,"text":"for enhancing the interoperability, then started standardization and"},{"start":21706.894,"end":21709.393,"text":"fairness, and also in the relation with"},{"start":21710.974,"end":21712.374,"text":"Darwin Core format."},{"start":21714.094,"end":21717.654,"text":"And we are mapping this type of"},{"start":21717.974,"end":21721.774,"text":"information using Darwin Core terms, and"},{"start":21722.034,"end":21725.594,"text":"we try to develop a"},{"start":21726.034,"end":21727.854,"text":"data package generator."},{"start":21728.554,"end":21732.034,"text":"It's just an R"},{"start":21732.094,"end":21732.774,"text":"function"},{"start":21735.594,"end":21738.754,"text":"as an example of the possibility to"},{"start":21740.374,"end":21742.794,"text":"transform our data in data package."},{"start":21743.454,"end":21744.114,"text":"This is a"},{"start":21746.534,"end":21749.914,"text":"table. We produce a list of"},{"start":21750.474,"end":21753.074,"text":"terms that is like"},{"start":21756.314,"end":21759.994,"text":"a field of a different table in our"},{"start":21760.074,"end":21761.734,"text":"template. And"},{"start":21762.654,"end":21766.454,"text":"for each term, as is possible, we have also"},{"start":21767.394,"end":21770.654,"text":"Darwin Core match, and the URI, and some"},{"start":21771.034,"end":21771.674,"text":"example"},{"start":21772.494,"end":21775.353,"text":"for our different unit for different terms."},{"start":21776.334,"end":21776.854,"text":"And this is"},{"start":21778.174,"end":21778.494,"text":"the"},{"start":21779.774,"end":21779.794,"text":"R"},{"start":21780.734,"end":21783.854,"text":"script or function in order to transform"},{"start":21784.494,"end":21785.534,"text":"our data in"},{"start":21786.454,"end":21787.754,"text":"data template, in"},{"start":21788.894,"end":21791.194,"text":"data package, using the approach of"},{"start":21791.994,"end":21794.054,"text":"frictionless."},{"start":21796.274,"end":21800.234,"text":"And that's all. I wanted to final remarks to the"},{"start":21800.294,"end":21804.274,"text":"point of view of ELTER. ELTER data reporting format"},{"start":21804.334,"end":21808.274,"text":"provide a common framework for integrated heterogeneous"},{"start":21808.374,"end":21811.794,"text":"ecological observation across site and domain."},{"start":21812.554,"end":21814.094,"text":"And semantic enrichment"},{"start":21815.334,"end":21818.874,"text":"through controlled vocabulary and Darwin Core alignment increase the"},{"start":21818.914,"end":21822.434,"text":"visibility of ELTER data. And"},{"start":21822.894,"end":21826.554,"text":"in the future, automatic publication of workflow enable"},{"start":21826.954,"end":21829.034,"text":"ELTER dataset to become"},{"start":21830.214,"end":21832.274,"text":"FAIR more than actually"},{"start":21833.674,"end":21836.514,"text":"situation. And thank you so much for your attention."},{"start":21842.214,"end":21842.614,"text":"That's great."},{"start":21843.614,"end":21844.194,"text":"Any questions?"},{"start":21847.374,"end":21847.694,"text":"Yes, ma'am."},{"start":21851.654,"end":21852.974,"text":"Hi. So thanks for the talk."},{"start":21853.894,"end":21857.814,"text":"So I see that you are trying to map your data to Darwin Core data standards, and"},{"start":21857.874,"end":21860.654,"text":"I wonder, have you looked into Darwin Core data package?"},{"start":21860.754,"end":21863.994,"text":"Because it's clearly more data than can be accommodated by Darwin Core archive."},{"start":21864.394,"end":21868.014,"text":"But I wonder if you looked into data package, and if so, have you identified any"},{"start":21868.134,"end":21872.114,"text":"gaps, something that is in your data but still cannot be expressed in data package,"},{"start":21872.254,"end":21875.754,"text":"or is it enough for your needs? Did you look into it?"},{"start":21876.154,"end":21876.374,"text":"Thanks."},{"start":21878.694,"end":21879.774,"text":"Yeah, more or less"},{"start":21880.994,"end":21882.474,"text":"it's enough for"},{"start":21883.294,"end":21883.474,"text":"us."},{"start":21885.494,"end":21888.854,"text":"Probably, the missing part is related to the"},{"start":21888.914,"end":21892.814,"text":"facilities, because in our case, we"},{"start":21892.874,"end":21894.894,"text":"have the strong relation"},{"start":21896.274,"end":21899.594,"text":"through the data to the site, and"},{"start":21899.634,"end":21903.273,"text":"this part is probably"},{"start":21903.333,"end":21905.213,"text":"missing. That's all."},{"start":21915.214,"end":21915.894,"text":"Thank you very much."},{"start":21919.614,"end":21923.174,"text":"I was just wondering, because I see you created an"},{"start":21923.734,"end":21926.954,"text":"endpoint where you basically alias Darwin Core"},{"start":21928.054,"end":21930.254,"text":"terms to your own namespace."},{"start":21931.554,"end":21931.914,"text":"No, we"},{"start":21937.554,"end":21941.454,"text":"created a vocabulary for our terms,"},{"start":21942.674,"end":21944.454,"text":"like Darwin Core."},{"start":21945.894,"end":21949.134,"text":"And we use the same approach in order to"},{"start":21949.634,"end":21949.914,"text":"list"},{"start":21951.134,"end":21954.714,"text":"terms of our vocabulary to describe the data,"},{"start":21955.434,"end":21957.194,"text":"and we realize the"},{"start":21958.734,"end":21959.534,"text":"mapping for"},{"start":21960.594,"end":21964.414,"text":"align our vocabulary of terms to the Darwin Core."},{"start":21965.274,"end":21967.354,"text":"That's the object."},{"start":21973.714,"end":21977.294,"text":"I have a question regarding that. So you mentioned that you have this Darwin Core"},{"start":21977.354,"end":21981.254,"text":"match there. Is that for all of the terms you have there, or are there"},{"start":21981.314,"end":21984.974,"text":"terms which don't have that, and how are you modulating that since it's not shown"},{"start":21984.994,"end":21985.454,"text":"on the slide?"},{"start":21989.794,"end":21992.874,"text":"Not all the terms are matching."},{"start":21993.554,"end":21994.734,"text":"And yeah,"},{"start":21996.334,"end":21998.014,"text":"in this example, we"},{"start":21999.574,"end":21999.934,"text":"present"},{"start":22001.054,"end":22001.454,"text":"matching"},{"start":22002.554,"end":22005.654,"text":"terms. But for more of these,"},{"start":22007.374,"end":22009.894,"text":"I don't know. I don't remember, but for"},{"start":22010.934,"end":22014.234,"text":"a lot, there is not a match for Darwin Core."},{"start":22021.764,"end":22022.524,"text":"Thank you so much."}]